{"ticker":"BF-B","updated":"2026-10-30T22:37:00Z","profile":{"longName":"Brown-Forman Corporation","shortName":"Brown Forman Inc","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Beverages - Wineries & Distilleries","country":"United States","website":"https://www.brown-forman.com","fullTimeEmployees":4900,"marketCap":13173992448,"trailingPE":18.522581,"forwardPE":16.751757,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.3650043,"pegRatio":2.14,"targetMeanPrice":28.25882,"targetHighPrice":35.0,"targetLowPrice":20.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.014,"earningsGrowth":0.057,"grossMargins":0.60664004,"operatingMargins":0.27552,"profitMargins":0.18416001,"totalRevenue":3915000064,"beta":0.324,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":31.92,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":22.61,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.3},"summary":"Brown-Forman Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures, distills, bottles, imports, exports, markets, and sells a variety of alcohol beverages. The company provides spirits, wines, whiskey spirits, whiskey-based flavored liqueurs, ready-to-drink cocktails, ready-to-pour products, vodkas, tequilas, gin, brandy, rum, bourbons, and liqueurs. The company offers its products primarily under the Jack Daniel's, Woodford Reserve, Old Forester, Gentleman Jack, Herradura, el Jimador, Fords Gin, The Glendronach, Chambord, Coopers' Craft, Diplomático, Benriach, Glenglassaugh, and Slane brands. It is also involved in the sale of used barrels, and bulk whiskey and wine; and provision of contract bottling services. The company serves retail customers and consumers through distributors and state governments; and retailers, wholesalers, and provincial governments directly. It operates in the United States, Germany, Australia, the United Kingdom, Canada, Spain, France, Mexico, Poland, Brazil, Türkiye, and internationally. Brown-Forman Corporation was founded in 1870 and is headquartered in Louisville, Kentucky.","summary_zh":"Brown-Forman Corporation 及其子公司生產、蒸餾、裝瓶、進口、出口、行銷和銷售各種酒精飲料。該公司提供烈酒、葡萄酒、威士忌烈酒、威士忌風味利口酒、即飲雞尾酒、即飲產品、伏特加、龍舌蘭酒、琴酒、白蘭地、蘭姆酒、波本酒和利口酒。該公司主要以 Jack Daniel's、Woodford Reserve、Old Forester、Gentleman Jack、Herradura、el Jimador、Fords Gin、The Glendronach、Chambord、Coopers' Craft、Diplomatico、Benriach、Glenglassaugh 和 Slane 品牌提供產品。它還涉及二手酒桶、散裝威士忌和葡萄酒的銷售；並提供合約裝瓶服務。該公司透過分銷商和州政府為零售客戶和消費者提供服務；直接與零售商、批發商和省政府聯繫。它在美國、德國、澳洲、英國、加拿大、西班牙、法國、墨西哥、波蘭、巴西、土耳其和國際上開展業務。 Brown-Forman Corporation 成立於 1870 年，總部位於肯塔基州路易斯維爾。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"飲料 - 釀酒廠和釀酒廠","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":29.58,"h":29.74,"l":28.78,"c":29.14,"v":3448600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":28.72,"h":28.96,"l":28.06,"c":28.2,"v":3453800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":28.49,"h":28.57,"l":27.91,"c":28.2,"v":3411900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":28.14,"h":28.99,"l":27.95,"c":28.91,"v":3472100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":28.56,"h":28.7,"l":27.4,"c":27.59,"v":3764100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":27.51,"h":28.14,"l":27.45,"c":27.46,"v":2921200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":27.29,"h":27.51,"l":27.19,"c":27.27,"v":3008000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":27.29,"h":27.63,"l":27.18,"c":27.44,"v":3342900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":27.47,"h":27.56,"l":26.88,"c":27.51,"v":3114200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":27.78,"h":27.9,"l":27.11,"c":27.36,"v":3388800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":27.4,"h":27.6,"l":27.12,"c":27.32,"v":3089900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":27.43,"h":28.11,"l":27.39,"c":27.43,"v":3298100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":27.35,"h":27.84,"l":27.35,"c":27.48,"v":3104500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":27.66,"h":27.71,"l":27.2,"c":27.48,"v":8297500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":27.22,"h":27.32,"l":26.77,"c":26.87,"v":3236200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":27.11,"h":27.23,"l":26.82,"c":27.03,"v":3220900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":26.88,"h":27.73,"l":26.87,"c":27.64,"v":2566400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":27.65,"h":27.72,"l":26.73,"c":26.74,"v":3458800},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":27.0,"h":27.23,"l":26.71,"c":27.1,"v":2425000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":27.28,"h":27.28,"l":26.87,"c":27.07,"v":2778400},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":27.18,"h":27.25,"l":26.78